fakemousewheelie
================
This project is a modified fork of "Mouse Wheelie" (https://github.com/Siphalor/mouse-wheelie),
Copyright Siphalor and contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).
It is NOT the official Mouse Wheelie and is not endorsed by its authors.

Changes made in this fork (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):
 - Mod id/name changed from "mousewheelie"/"Mouse Wheelie" to "fakemousewheelie"; assets namespace,
   translation keys, mixin config file, config file name and network channel ids renamed accordingly.
   The Java package (de.siphalor.mousewheelie) is unchanged to keep the diff small.
 - Added a Minecraft 26.3 build configuration (gradle/mc-26.3.0); toolchain bumped (Fabric Loader 0.20.1,
   Fabric Loom 1.17.21, Gradle 9.5.1).
 - Shutdown hardening: background threads are daemon threads, the interaction scheduler is stopped on
   ClientLifecycleEvents.CLIENT_STOPPING, scheduled tasks are guarded, locks are released in finally blocks.
 - Removed upstream publishing automation, CI workflows and project IDs (Modrinth/CurseForge/GitHub/Maven).
 - Declared a conflict with the original "mousewheelie" mod (both cannot be installed together).
 - Added right-drag (one item per slot) and left-drag (collect matching items) inventory tweaks,
   ported from Mouse Tweaks (see below).
Original copyright and license notices are retained in LICENSE and in the source file headers.

